  "details": "The white tracker balls now appear when grabbing objects like the Camera, and can linger around for a while after you move your hands off the object. I didn't time it but it's quite long, at least 10 seconds.\n\nI remember this happening sometimes in Live before, but only noticed the long disappearance time in open beta 1484 (reported previously at https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1484-controller-models-now-appear-in-camera)\n\nThe disable tooltips option doesn't affect this like it does the controller models.\n\nIf there's no useful reason for them to appear when grabbing objects, can they be removed?",
